# The Vercel CLI does not honor .gitignore for its own upload filtering,
# so local secret files must be excluded here explicitly — a local .env
# was previously uploaded during `vercel --prod` and silently shadowed the
# dashboard-configured CRON_SECRET at runtime, causing Vercel's own Cron
# trigger (which sends the dashboard's secret) to fail with 401.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
